<title>DUBAI: Saudi October well-head oil output 8.022 mln bpd.</title>
<headline>Saudi October well-head oil output 8.022 mln bpd.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia's crude production at the well-head hit 8.022 million barrels per day (bpd) in October, a Gulf source said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The kingdom's supply to the market reached 8.003 million bpd, the source said.</p>
<p>This is slightly above its OPEC supply quota of 8.00 million bpd.</p>
<p>Riyadh is the world's largest oil producer and exporter.</p>
<p>-- Steven Swindells, Dubai Newsroom, +971 4 6071255</p>
